# TIRO alone, a win: 14 girls hit, +2100 (README.md, docs/tiro/DESIGN.md).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame tiro --headless --ms 60000 --input tools/play/tiro-alone-win.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame tiro --headless --ms 60000 --fix all --input tools/play/tiro-alone-win.input
#
# Generated by `tools/tiro_plan.py --start 0 --win` (TIRO's WM_CREATE at 0
# ms seeds the targets' pictures; the hits change them too). Every shot is
# a SPACE press with the arrow free, at least 110 ms after the last press.
# One script for both versions, 16 presses, the same result at different
# times:
# - Original: TIRO ends at the first target tick after the 15th press
#   (34930 ms; BUGS.md T3, T4); the 16th press finds it gone.
# - `--fix all`: the 15th arrow flies and misses, the 16th is fired once
#   it has landed, misses too, and TIRO ends when that one has stopped
#   (38890 ms; T2, T4).
# The result is checked at 39000, after both.
